-430\" srcset=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-dept-dermatology.jpg 700w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-dept-dermatology-300x171.jpg 300w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-dept-dermatology-18x10.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\" /></figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Treatments and services</h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid is-layout-grid wp-container-core-group-is-layout-5e4b10ce wp-block-group-is-layout-grid\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Medical dermatology</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Diagnosis, treatment and follow-up of a wide range of skin, hair and nail diseases.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Dermatosurgery</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Surgical procedures on the skin, for example for moles or skin lesions that need removal or examination.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cosmetic dermatology</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Dermatocosmetic procedures including laser applications, botulinum toxin (Botox) and chemical peels.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Genital skin conditions</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Diagnosis and treatment of genital warts, molluscum, genital herpes, external genital fungal infections and syphilis.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Skin cancer and mole assessment</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Examination of moles and suspicious lesions, and treatment planning for skin cancers.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section medlux-columns has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Conditions treated</h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Acne</li>\n\n<li>Psoriasis</li>\n\n<li>Eczema</li>\n\n<li>Skin allergies</li>\n\n<li>Nappy rash in babies</li>\n\n<li>Hives (urticaria)</li>\n\n<li>Warts</li>\n\n<li>Fungal diseases</li>\n\n<li>Moles</li>\n\n<li>Skin cancers</li>\n\n<li>Oral ulcers</li>\n\n<li>Hair loss</li>\n\n<li>Nail diseases</li>\n\n<li>Beh\u00e7et&#8217;s disease</li>\n\n<li>Genital warts and molluscum</li>\n\n<li>Genital herpes</li>\n\n<li>External genital fungal infections</li>\n\n<li>Syphilis</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Before you travel</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">To get a reliable medical opinion quickly, please prepare:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Recent medical reports and discharge summaries</li>\n\n<li>Imaging (MRI, CT, X-ray) on CD or as DICOM files, with the radiology reports</li>\n\n<li>Recent laboratory results</li>\n\n<li>A list of your current medications and any allergies</li>\n\n<li>Photographs showing how the skin condition has changed over time</li>\n\n<li>Previous skin biopsy or pathology reports</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\